#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:324
msgid ""
"Carriers limit how large a multimedia message can be. Images and videos you "
"attach are automatically compressed to fit under this limit before sending.\n"
"\n"
"600 kB is a safe default for most carriers. Pick a smaller value if your "
"messages fail to send, or a larger one if you know your carrier allows it."
msgstr ""
"Mametra ny haben'ny hafatra multimedia ny mpandraharaha. Ny sary sy horonan-"
"tsary ampiarahinao dia aporitra ho azy mba ho latsaky io fetra io alohan'ny "
"andefasana.\n"
"\n"
"Ny 600 kB dia sanda voafaritra mialoha azo antoka ho an'ny ankamaroan'ny "
"mpandraharaha. Misafidiana sanda kely kokoa raha tsy lasa ny hafatrao, na "
"lehibe kokoa raha fantatrao fa mamela izany ny mpandraharahanao."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:352
msgid ""
"Merging calls into a conference is up to the carrier, and in our testing the "
"results varied from working to dropping the calls. Turn this on to try it on "
"your own subscription. It cannot be officially supported, so leave it off if "
"you would rather your calls behaved predictably."
msgstr "Miankina amin'ny orinasan-telefona ny fampiraisana antso ho antso an-tarika, ary tamin'ny fitsapanay dia niovaova ny vokatra, nanomboka tamin'ny fiasa tsara ka hatramin'ny fanapahana ny antso. Alefaso ity hanandramana azy amin'ny tsipikanao. Tsy azo omena fanohanana ofisialy izany, ka avelao mihidy raha tianao hiasa araka ny antenainao ny antsonao."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:360
msgid ""
"Transferring two calls to each other needs a service the carrier has to "
"provide, and in our testing many carriers either refuse it or end the calls "
"instead. Turn this on to try it on your own subscription. It cannot be "
"officially supported, so leave it off if you would rather your calls behaved "
"predictably."
msgstr "Mila serivisy tsy maintsy omen'ny orinasan-telefona ny fampifandraisana antso roa, ary tamin'ny fitsapanay dia nandà izany ny orinasa maro na nanapaka ny antso. Alefaso ity hanandramana azy amin'ny tsipikanao. Tsy azo omena fanohanana ofisialy izany, ka avelao mihidy raha tianao hiasa araka ny antenainao ny antsonao."

#: src/telephony/client/ui/windows/advanced_settings_window.py:371
msgid ""
"When the modem stops responding, the phone quietly restarts the modem stack "
"by itself and you only hear about it if that fails. The phone is never "
"rebooted automatically. When this is off, the Modem Recovery screen appears "
"instead so you can run the restart yourself."
msgstr "Rehefa mijanona tsy mamaly ny modem, dia ny telefona ihany no manomboka indray mangina ny rindrambaikon'ny modem, ary tsy mahalala izany ianao raha tsy hoe tsy nahomby izany. Tsy atao manomboka indray ho azy mihitsy ny telefona. Rehefa mihidy ity, dia miseho kosa ny efijery famerenana ny modem, mba hanaovanao ny famerenana ianao ihany."

